        "text_TtEBw9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At , every formulation begins with nature’s purest essence. We carefully select authentic Ayurvedic ingredients sourced from certified farms and trusted herbal suppliers across India. Each herb, extract, oil, butter, and natural active used in our products is tested for purity, potency, and safety — ensuring that only the best reaches your skin and hair. <br/><br/>Every ingredient at  is handled with utmost care - cleaned, sorted, and processed using gentle Ayurvedic techniques that retain its natural potency. Our formulations are prepared in small batches to preserve freshness, color, and aroma, ensuring every product feels alive with herbal vitality. <br/><br/>All our products are free from parabens, ammonia, sulfur, silicones, and mineral oils, staying true to the Ayurvedic principle of <em>swasthya rakshanam</em> — protecting and nurturing wellness through pure, natural formulations. Every creation reflects our commitment to clean, conscious beauty that respects both the body and nature.</p>",
